  eventID: MeetingRoomExited
  dialogueLines:
  - I guess you hate a bit of chatter, because damn, you left that quickly
  - "Oh, I see. You\u2019re not a fan of conversation, apparently. You really got
    out of there fast"
  - Guess a little bit of yapping was enough to send you running. Damn
  - "Wow, you really don\u2019t like people talking, huh? You barely lasted in there"
  - "I guess casual conversation isn\u2019t your thing. You couldn\u2019t leave that
    room fast enough"
